<view class="page about-page" data-theme="{{appTheme}}">
  <view class="about-hero">
    <image class="about-hero__mountain" src="/assets/profile/profile-header-mist-v2.jpg" mode="aspectFill" />
    <view class="about-hero__veil"></view>
    <view class="about-hero__content"><view class="about-mark">今</view><view class="about-brand-copy"><view class="about-title">今日成长-目标打卡</view><view class="about-version">版本 {{version}}</view></view></view>
  </view>
  <view class="card about-card">
    <view class="about-heading">记录今日行动，看见目标进度。</view>
    <view class="about-copy">今日成长-目标打卡通过每日行动、目标进度、小队同行和 AI 教练，帮助你保持自己的节奏。所有进度、投入和复盘都来自真实行动记录。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="card about-card about-card--small">
    <view class="about-heading">帮助与反馈</view>
    <view class="about-copy">遇到数据同步、隐私或功能问题时，请说明发生时间和操作路径；不要在反馈中填写完整手机号、OpenID 或其他敏感凭证。</view>
    <button class="feedback-button" open-type="feedback">通过微信提交反馈</button>
  </view>
  <view class="card about-card about-card--small">
    <view class="about-link" bindtap="openPrivacy"><text>隐私政策</text><t-icon name="chevron-right" size="30rpx" /></view>
    <view class="about-link" bindtap="openTerms"><text>用户协议</text><t-icon name="chevron-right" size="30rpx" /></view>
  </view>
  <view class="about-footnote">正式上线前，运营主体、联系方式和候选法律文本仍需完成合规审核。</view>
</view>
